# OpenGL ES and EGL's boot test (boot-venus, D183): gl-test, in C over libEGL.so and libGLESv2.so, draws into a
# pbuffer and a window of Radharc's through the core and reads back what it drew (gl-test(8)). compose-test waits for it
# and judges its exit code. It starts after Radharc, whose window it opens.
service gl-test
program gl-test
use windows
mount /dev devmgr/dev
